  "goodToKnow": "Das Privatleben is private life: Beruf und Privatleben, sich ins Privatleben zurückziehen (to retire into private life). Many Germans separate the two quite strictly: colleagues may not ask about your Privatleben, and calling a coworker in the evening can feel intrusive. Celebrities in Germany have strong legal protection of their Privatleben. Related: die Privatsphäre (privacy), privat (private), Privatsache (a private matter)."
